{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>The firstborn according to his birthright.</b> He strikes the goblet and calls: Reuben, Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, Zebulun — sons of one mother — sit in this order, which is the order of your genealogy, and so all of them. When he reached Benjamin, he said: This one has no mother and I have no mother — let him sit beside me."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:25.189347632Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}